# The full pipeline: sema → codegen → server. docs/compiler/testing.md §8.2.

### the home page is rendered on the server
GET /home
>>> 200
content-type: text/html; charset=utf-8
~ <h1>Hello from Kobra</h1>
~ <script type="application/json" id="k-data">

### the rpc answers its struct as the message
POST /hello.home.GreeterProtocol/Greet
content-type: application/json
connect-protocol-version: 1

{"name": "<Ana>"}
>>> 200
cache-control: private, no-store
json {"text": "Hello, <Ana>"}

### a request that isn't a message is invalid_argument
POST /hello.home.GreeterProtocol/Greet
content-type: application/json
connect-protocol-version: 1

{"name": 3}
>>> 400
~ "invalid_argument"

### an unknown page is a 404
GET /nowhere
>>> 404
